                  Wuppertal, Di. 23.08.1994 20:58:58 Hello David,This is my complet oleo archiv.On the CMDS directory is the current executable version.I hope it will run on your 68070!My oleo has a little different default key binding!Please use the command to show the current bindings at first!!With this sources (patches) it is possible to generateversions of oleo with different memory usages. The problemis the count of rows and columns. You can make your ownoleo with less (or more) columns by modifying the makefile.The makefile is for my own make, it is possible that it doesn'twork with the microware make.To generate a new version i added all my private librarys whichare used in this projekt:  libs/htlib.l     -- my own unix comp. lib for use with microware C  libs/htlibg.l    -- "   "   "    "      "  "   "   "   GCC2.5.7  libs/libcurses.l -- my implementation from curses lib!I added also the source from the used curses lib.The DEFS directory is a copy of my. You don't need all that Filesto compile the projekt, but i don't want sort them for you. To recompile the complete source you need bison or yacc also.Have Fun		Martin